{"title": "Threatened (Condition)", "pageid": 5486, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)", "categories": ["No status groups", "Has tick type", "No stack type", "No stack priority", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For items that interact with it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_set\" title=\"Threatened set\">Threatened set</a>.   </div>  \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Threatened</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>An enemy is close. Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on ranged <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">FLANKED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FLANKED+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FLANKED+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">FLANKED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CFLANKED%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CFLANKED%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: N/A\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Threatened\">Sources of Threatened</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Being within the melee range of a hostile creature in combat.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A creature's melee range can be affected by the <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_reach\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Extra reach\">reach</a> of their melee weapon.</li>\n<li>The condition itself has no effect on attacks against the threatening enemy; the disadvantage only applies to ranged attacks against other creatures. If multiple enemies are in threatening range, then the Threatened creature will have disadvantage against all of them.</li>\n<li>However, there is also a separate source of disadvantage (\"Target is too close\") when making a ranged attack from within 3 m (10 ft) of a target, meaning most creatures will have disadvantage on ranged attacks against a threatening creature.\n<ul><li>This can be removed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow_Expert:_Point-Blank\" title=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/20px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/30px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/40px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/20px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow_Expert:_Point-Blank\" title=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\">Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank</a>, making it possible to use <a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crossbow\">crossbow</a> attacks without disadvantage against an enemy at close range. This does not work, however, if one is Threatened by multiple creatures.</li>\n<li>Because of how the \"Target is too close\" effect is implemented, it is possible for a target to be within an aura with a range of 3 m (10 ft) (such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Murder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Murder_(Bhaalist_Armour)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Murder (Bhaalist Armour) (Condition)\">Aura of Murder</a>) while not being close enough to grant disadvantage on ranged attacks. This is because the effect measures the distance from the <i>centre</i> of the attacker to the target, while an aura accounts for the <i>size</i> of a creature's hitbox.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When attacking a very large target, like the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_Red_Dragon\" title=\"Dominated Red Dragon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png/20px-Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png/30px-Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png/40px-Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dominated Red Dragon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d8/Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png/20px-Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d8/Portrait_Dominated_Red_Dragon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_Red_Dragon\" title=\"Dominated Red Dragon\">Dominated Red Dragon</a>, multiple parts of it may threaten the attacker at once, as if surrounded by multiple enemies, causing all ranged attacks to have disadvantage. This makes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow_Expert:_Point-Blank\" title=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/20px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/30px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/40px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp/20px-Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Crossbow_Expert_Point-Blank_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crossbow_Expert:_Point-Blank\" title=\"Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank\">Crossbow Expert: Point-Blank</a> useless against such targets.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202648\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2553/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30504/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12471/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1292345/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.373      1 -total\n 99.24%   74.797      1 Template:Condition_page\n 40.44%   30.483      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 30.02%   22.626      8 Template:Icon_link\n 28.82%   21.725      8 Template:Icon_text\n 20.70%   15.600     26 Template:Trim\n 20.13%   15.172      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.75%    8.856      2 Template:SmSAI\n 11.24%    8.469      1 Template:Disadvantage\n 10.93%    8.235      9 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:5486-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202648 and revision id 395134. Re